    <div class="course-overview py-4 py-lg-5">
        <div class="custom-container">
            <div class="row g-4">
                <div class="col-lg-7">
                    <h2 class="heading-medium mb-3 mb-lg-4 text-white">Data Science & Machine Learning Program
                        <span>Course
                            Overview</span>
                    </h2>

                    <div class="accordion" id="accordionExample2">

                        <!-- 1. Introduction -->
                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                    data-bs-target="#collapseaOne" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="collapseaOne">
                                    Introduction to Data Science and Machine Learning Course
                                </button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="collapseaOne" class="accordion-collapse collapse show"
                                data-bs-parent="#accordionExample2">
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    <p>Data Science and Machine Learning are among the most in-demand technologies of
                                        the modern era. These technologies empower businesses to extract meaningful
                                        insights from large volumes of raw and unstructured data, enabling smarter
                                        decision-making and innovation across industries.</p>

                                    <p>With the rapidly growing demand for skilled data professionals, pursuing a Data
                                        Science and Machine Learning course has become essential for building a
                                        successful career in the data-driven world. The <strong>Introduction to Data
                                            Science and Machine Learning Course by E&ICT IIT Roorkee</strong> is
                                        designed to equip learners with strong foundational knowledge and practical
                                        skills required to work with real-world data.</p>

                                    <p>This comprehensive program introduces learners to scientific methods, data
                                        analysis techniques, and machine learning models used to uncover patterns,
                                        trends, and insights from big data. The course follows a hands-on approach and
                                        focuses on industry-relevant use cases to help students understand real business
                                        challenges and modern work environments.</p>

                                    <div class="highlight-box">
                                        <h5 class="mb-3 fw-bold">What You Will Learn</h5>
                                        <ul class="mb-0">
                                            <li>Introduction to Data Science and Machine Learning concepts</li>
                                            <li>Fundamentals of data analysis and data preprocessing</li>
                                            <li>Supervised and Unsupervised Machine Learning algorithms</li>
                                            <li>Real-world applications of Machine Learning in business</li>
                                            <li>Introduction to Python for Data Science</li>
                                            <li>Practical projects and case studies</li>
                                        </ul>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- 2. Why Online -->
                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                    data-bs-target="#collapseaTwo">
                                    Why Online Data Science and Machine Learning Course?
                                </button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="collapseaTwo" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                                data-bs-parent="#accordionExample2">
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    <p>Choosing an online Data Science course gives you the flexibility to learn at your
                                        own pace and from the comfort of your home. This course allows you to access
                                        expert training, live sessions, and practical resources without attending
                                        traditional classes.</p>

                                    <div class="highlight-box">
                                        <strong>Key Advantages of Online Learning:</strong>
                                        <ul class="mb-0 mt-2">
                                            <li>Flexible schedule - perfect for working professionals</li>
                                            <li>Access recorded sessions anytime, anywhere</li>
                                            <li>Live doubt-clearing sessions with IIT Roorkee mentors</li>
                                            <li>Cost-effective compared to offline programs</li>
                                            <li>Learn from anywhere in India with high-speed internet</li>
                                        </ul>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- 3. Learning Objectives -->
                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                    data-bs-target="#collapseaThree">
                                    What are the Learning Objectives of This Data Science Machine Learning Course?
                                </button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="collapseaThree" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                                data-bs-parent="#accordionExample2">
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    <p>Data Science teaches you how to work with data and use it to solve real problems.
                                        You will practice machine learning, learn tools for changing and analyzing data,
                                        and understand basic data mining. You will also learn how to create simple
                                        visuals and improve results using optimization techniques. By the end, you will
                                        be ready to use common tools and technologies used in Data Science and Machine
                                        Learning.</p>

                                    <div class="highlight-box">
                                        <strong>Core Learning Outcomes:</strong>
                                        <ul class="mb-0 mt-2">
                                            <li>Master data analysis and preprocessing techniques</li>
                                            <li>Implement supervised and unsupervised ML algorithms</li>
                                            <li>Build data visualizations for business insights</li>
                                            <li>Apply optimization techniques for model performance</li>
                                            <li>Use industry-standard Data Science tools and libraries</li>
                                        </ul>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- 4. Skills Gained -->
                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                    data-bs-target="#collapsea4">
                                    What Skills and Techniques Will I Gain From This Data Science Course?
                                </button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="collapsea4" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                                data-bs-parent="#accordionExample2">
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    <p>This course will teach you how to analyze data using Python and R, apply machine
                                        learning algorithms, and build AI systems. You will also learn data
                                        visualization to present insights clearly and improve your programming skills.
                                        By the end, you'll know how to deploy machine learning models, equipping you
